{{! The hamburger's own menu (Figma 316:335019 "Navbar Menu [Open]"): site
    links, the repo button and the theme toggle, on the blue tint. Separate
    from the page tree, which is an inline collapsible section -- the burger
    stays a hamburger in both of the tree's states. Mobile only; the desktop
    navbar carries these controls itself. }}
<div class="site-menu" id="site-menu">
  <div class="site-menu-inner">
    <div class="site-menu-links">
      <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://www.mrdocs.com">Mr.Docs</a>
      <a class="site-menu-link" href="https://cppalliance.org/">The C++ Alliance</a>
      <a class="site-menu-repo" href="https://github.com/cppalliance/mrdocs">
        <span class="site-menu-repo-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>GitHub Repo
      </a>
    </div>
    {{> theme-toggle class="site-menu-theme"}}
  </div>
</div>
